Decisions resolved (PLAN.md §15 deferral):
- Benchmark series = a parameter: run_monthly_review(benchmark_return=...) (the period
  return to compare each sleeve against, SPY-style by default 0.0). Configurable rather
  than hardcoded SPY-vs-blended; caller passes whatever benchmark it tracks.

Design notes:
- Action priority: suspend (risk suspension OR graduation retire) > increase (graduation
  promote) > reduce (DD beyond reduce_drawdown, or trails benchmark beyond
  reduce_underperformance) > hold. A non-permitted sleeve that still holds positions is
  pulled back to 'reduce' and noted. Sizing breaches (position/sector) are flagged as
  notes, not auto-actions.
- Sleeves outside the permission matrix (cash_reserve, experimental_research) are treated
  as ungated (permitted=True).
- monthly_review owns evaluation only; reporting owns rendering only (§3 boundary).

