Design notes:
- Archetypes use plain causal rolling stats (sign(price-MA), pct_change, Donchian
  ffill, fast/slow MA, 200MA filter) — the reversion vs trend/momentum/breakout
  distinction the platform previously lacked (its estimators+signal engine are
  reversion-only). All return {-1,0,1} int paths and inherit Model.backtest -> the whole
  validation/scoring/graduation stack for free.
